      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "吊桥……能够锻炼下半身，促进健康。\n但对年轻族群来说，似乎稍嫌硬派呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "600ad95736b462c1d24fac425f4102a41300f58278de145dcfb9dc730c0058ac",
