    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31b384b734bc09dd8593df10",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "说到我这个世代的偏好，\n不外乎“游乐园”、“游泳池”、\n“户外游乐设施”等项目。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1a1287709c907f31e288e8471841bd372297f0d92ce3ebfee6ed92ce6b0194f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
