    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82c0b9118b7a0e4fbae27eef",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因此，提供着重于\n“能与同行者得到相同体验”的设施，\n应该就能顺应时下潮流。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8bad901bac278ee46c23935dcefd2b909d1fd0359a221242839c431b758909de",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085704.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e53ed46fb129d52588c8f7bd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第一红宝石",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b56cd884b7441b8b32119740e379b8bc7aa840838b1c62bd9418c4a41cbf2b4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085704.json",
      "json_path": [
