    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96ba7a4714580c75f8d6a45e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而游泳池类的休闲设施，赋予其主题性\n也许就能营造出不同于日常的感觉。\n例如宇宙或丛林，应该就具有高度的沉浸感。",
      "source_fingerprint": "742e03b9f17cde70c98b87362a0173f4d09d0ec943436b52308ee3f8cb5c7554",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085704.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b41cbf10a469dc8d4a82bd3f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第一红宝石",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b56cd884b7441b8b32119740e379b8bc7aa840838b1c62bd9418c4a41cbf2b4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
