      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在这个基础上设置一些\n能适度活动身体的设备，\n应该就能让年轻族群玩得尽兴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6fbb0d994c0f30bba06d8bc085a256de2ff1319a9e1c37966e56076043f49e9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085704.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
