      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "若再搭配适合在社交平台分享的上相场景，\n甚至还有机会“爆红”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c682d8a021ff3e711b0074db1af19f997f5b1b717e043ac1d92cbe0c62c94e8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
