    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b821be2c1af675ebc31330c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "至于野外休闲设施，\n或许很难想像是为年轻族群所设计。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b066cee9a3dba178073f2e94c4bdb24a61ff431170438154bb15fcb49ee9eb7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
