    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f9fab265ada23d272d07ab3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但近来开始出现追求健康的倾向。\n这在年轻世代间也不例外。",
      "source_fingerprint": "807ea00190d1791241cf7c5280395a88c56e9b886ef58466088a69814fc108dd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
