      "uid": "zhcn:58fd38313f0b005868099853",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……我已收集到有益的资讯。\n差不多该回学园了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "97ede10464f58825dbd319fbad618e195edfd02e19a319cfec57677a5de772f9",
